# Four Colour Problem: borders between countries, like a map needing four
# colours -- a staircase frontier cuts off each corner, and a broken ring
# of borders surrounds a middle country.

NAME Four Colour Problem
SYMMETRY ROT4
WALLS K Y
START 8 8 SE

# The frontier, from the left edge up towards the top, with a pass at the
# top.
MOVE 1 12
DRAW 5 12
DRAW 5 8
DRAW 11 8
DRAW 11 4

# A side of the middle country's border.
MOVE 13 12
DRAW 13 14
